  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\" \n\nYou are now the queen bee, and you must guide your bee-clan to the safety of a nearby flower. You don't understand how this happened. The last you remembered, you were a human. Now, you're a bee. You have no idea what you're doing and you're supposed to be guiding an entire clan of bees.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 13,
  "reference_text": " \n\nYou're not alone. You have a bunch of bees following you. But ultimately you know that you're just flying around with no purpose. And you have no idea why all these bees are following you. You just know that you're now the Queen bee.\n\nYou're also wondering to yourself what happened.",
